  "content": "<h2><strong style=\"display:inline !important\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104729/description_39f2ddd6-7810-45f4-b9c2-2aa4b4f90cf7.png\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></h2><h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 關於《黑暗靈魂》擴充模組</strong></h2><p><strong>FazBrick Studios 團隊隆重推出《黑暗靈魂》擴充模組。本模組持續維護並更新至現代 Minecraft 版本，且完全支援多人連線遊玩。</strong></p><p><strong>本專案致力於將 Minecraft 轉化為 From Software 遊戲的風格與氛圍，同時保留原版遊戲的核心精髓。《黑暗靈魂》擴充模組擁有大量武器、建築、敵人與內容，確保玩家能獲得完全沉浸且愉悅的遊戲體驗。</strong></p><p><strong>此模組新增了一個名為「羅德蘭」的新維度，玩家大部分的遊戲時間將在此展開。在這個新維度中，你可以探索並面對新的敵人與頭目，同時升級你的武器、盔甲與法術。</strong></p><p><strong>本模組目前處於開發初期階段，將會持續更新，加入新內容並推進版本。</strong></p><h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 我可以將此模組加入模組包嗎？</strong></h2><p>當然可以！歡迎將此模組加入你的模組包。我們鼓勵你這麼做，只要別忘了標註出處即可。</p><h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;模組內容</strong></h2><p><strong>《黑暗靈魂》擴充模組包含大量建築與地下城，探索這些區域以及獲取強化資源與裝備將完全基於此系統。</strong></p><p><strong>目前專案包含：</strong></p><ul>\n<li>不死鎮地下城</li>\n<li>不死教區地下城</li>\n<li>賽恩古城</li>\n<li>聖所建築</li>\n<li>不死院地下城與頭目</li>\n<li>鐵匠安德烈工作站及以靈魂交易的新系統</li>\n<li>超過 45 種帶動畫的新武器</li>\n<li>超過 15 套受系列啟發的新盔甲組</li>\n<li>新的羅德蘭維度</li>\n<li>超過 20 種新生物</li>\n<li>以及更多內容！&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; <img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104729/description_8019b1c3-359e-47ad-b574-c4bc950a6176.png\"> &nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;</li>\n</ul><h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 開始遊玩</strong></h2><p><strong>要開始你的冒險，你必須在世界中尋找散落在新結構「墓園」的八塊遺跡碎片。將這些碎片與不死靈魂結合，即可獲得亞爾特留斯徽章。<br>此物品將是前往羅德蘭的關鍵，因為它是我們必須在世界中找到的新教堂中放置的鑰匙。一旦放入鑰匙，它將帶我們前往羅德蘭，從那裡我們可以自由探索世界，發現新結構與敵人。<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_cffd9d21-76bb-4f9d-a8ad-1f14a12e95d8.png\"></strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>在羅德蘭期間，我們將有三個主要結構可供掠奪並面對其各自的頭目。其中之一是鐵匠屋，我們可以用來向鐵匠購買新武器和物品，以靈魂作為交換。要啟用此功能，我們必須給予鐵匠一塊大型琥珀。<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_c55c89ae-d41a-46a2-8642-e3876e7a11b8.png\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_7c62398a-8e4f-470c-b591-842d5ad23e29.png\"></strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fapexhost.gg%252fMrFazCraft\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104729/description_fe39d778-c7f5-4342-8aed-fb925a1c4e16.png\"> </a></strong></p><p>🗡️ <strong>立即開始你的《黑暗靈魂》旅程！</strong> 透過 Nitrado 和 Apex Hosting 提供的一鍵伺服器安裝，你和你的朋友可以迅速投入《黑暗靈魂》擴充模組的殘酷世界！</p><p>要開始遊玩，你只需要一個至少 <strong>4GB RAM 或更多</strong> 的 Minecraft Java 伺服器（建議用於多人遊玩以獲得更流暢的體驗）。只需 <strong>從控制面板點擊一下</strong>，即可立即安裝 <strong>《黑暗靈魂》擴充模組 [CurseForge]</strong>，並在今天開始你的危險冒險！</p><p>&nbsp;</p><h2><strong>也試試官方《核爆之後》模組包！</strong></h2><p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/after-the-nukes\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1104729/description_947803e8-a182-4066-8184-9e5be075aed5.png\" width=\"509\" height=\"470\"></strong></a><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><h2>&nbsp;</h2><h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;再授權許可</strong></h2><p><strong>程式設計：MrFazCraft</strong></p><p><strong>3D 美術與動畫：Karlljp 與 MrFazCraft</strong></p><p><strong>你不被允許在 Curseforge 或 Modrinth 以外的網站或網域上傳或重新分發此模組。</strong></p><p><strong>這特別包括 RU-Minecraft。</strong></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><h2><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; 需求</strong></h2><p><strong>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/avatars/thumbnails/610/295/256/256/637992132011410133.png\" alt=\"GeckoLib - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</strong></p><p><strong> &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; </strong></p><p><strong>&nbsp;<img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/474/153/logo.png\" alt=\"Better Combat\" width=\"325\" height=\"95\">&nbsp; &nbsp; <span style=\"color:#fff\">或&nbsp; </span><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/iBWSME0.png\" alt=\"Epic Fight - Minecraft Mods - CurseForge\" width=\"406\" height=\"144\"></strong></p>",
